{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"brazier","model_identifier":"brazier","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# brazier\n\nBrazier: an iron bowl on three legs, about 1 m (34 u) tall.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -11..11, y 0..51, z -10..13 units (0.62 x 1.45 x 0.64 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 64 x 64, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 19.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 22 x 34 x 22 centred on the origin\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `lit` (visible by default): burning coals and flames\n- `unlit`: cold coal in the bowl\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `flicker` | 0.8 | loop | the flame group `flame` jitters (the light flicker itself is the game's) |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `fx_flame` at (0, 46, 0)\n- `fx_smoke` at (0, 54, 0)\n\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_coals_l, glow_flame, glow_flame_1, glow_flame_1_1, glow_flame_1_2, glow_flame_2, glow_flame_tongue\n"},"resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"leg0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.0,0.0,7.0],"to":[1.0,26.0,9.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,26,8.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[9.0,0.0,11.0,26.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[11.0,0.0,13.0,26.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[9.0,0.0,11.0,26.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[11.0,0.0,13.0,26.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[20.0,61.0,22.0,63.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[20.0,61.0,22.0,63.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"9b9fec14-07b8-5a60-bed7-951c999421fc","rotation":[-8.0,0,0.0]},{"name":"foot0